# Lab agent conventions

- Device agents are specialists; users talk to the Concierge only.
- Orchestration topologies use `inventory_id` as the specialist `agent_id`.
- MCP tools for NetBox are reference mocks unless connected to a real instance.
- Do not commit `.env`, credentials, or Cursor chat exports.
